# DesktopPilot — environment template
#
# All variables below are SERVER-SIDE only (read inside server handlers).
# Never prefix them with VITE_ — that would ship them to the browser.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI provider (Lovable AI Gateway)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Task planning runs through the built-in Lovable AI gateway. The gateway key
# (LOVABLE_API_KEY) is provisioned automatically by Lovable — you do not need
# to supply a provider API key or set it here.
#
# LOCAL RUNS (outside Lovable): LOVABLE_API_KEY is not available, so planning
# falls back to calling Gemini directly with your own key. Get one at
# https://aistudio.google.com/apikey and set:
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-key-here
#
# Optional: override the planning model. Use a gateway model id, e.g.
#   GEMINI_MODEL=google/gemini-2.5-flash
# (values containing "/" are used as-is; "gemini-…" gets the google/ prefix)

# Optional: shared token for internal (non-browser) callers of
# POST /api/tasks/plan. When set, requests must present
#   Authorization: Bearer <DESKTOPPILOT_SERVER_TOKEN>
# Browser requests instead rely on same-origin evidence (Origin/Referer
# matching the request URL). Leave unset for a browser-only deployment.
# DESKTOPPILOT_SERVER_TOKEN=replace-with-a-long-random-string

# Optional: local visual-agent worker HTTP port (worker/visual-agent).
# WORKER_PORT=8765
